Write modular tests using `org.junit` and `Mockito` for critical components, ensuring they can be run independently. Adopt a test-driven development approach.

9. Integration documentation:
Document all integration points with the external command-line tool, detailing expected inputs, outputs, and any potential anomalies.

This design serves as a starting point for your application implementation. Good luck with your project!']

