```java
public class VersionedObject<V> {
    private final int version;
    private final V value;

    public VersionedObject(int version, V value) {
        this.version = version;
        this.value = value;
    }

    // Getters and setters for version and value
}
```

5. **Version management**

A helper method to check if the version of a fetched object matches with the cached version.

```java
public class VersionChecker {
    private final int currentVersion;

    public VersionChecker(int currentVersion) {
        this.currentVersion = currentVersion;
    }

    public boolean versionMatches(VersionedObject<V> versionedObject) {
        return versionedObject.getVersion() == currentVersion;
    }
}
```

