Regarding the function to copy a specified number of bytes from a list of buffered data chunks:

```c
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <string.h>
void mergeBuffers(const void** src, size_t numSrc, void* dest, size_t len) {
    size_t total = 0;
    for (size_t i = 0; i < numSrc; ++i) {
        if ((total + len) > src[i][1]) len = src[i][1] - total;
        memcpy((char*)dest + total, src[i][0], len);
        total += len;
    }
}
```

